{"id":"dbf8e12e31001be4","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions.md","title":"Pullback-Stable Finite Subobject Unions","display":"df-stable-finite-subobject-unions — Pullback-Stable Finite Subobject Unions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions","aliases":["93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions"],"display":"df-stable-finite-subobject-unions — Pullback-Stable Finite Subobject Unions","depends_on":["[[93-df-finitely-complete-category]]","[[93-df-finite-subobject-join]]","[[93-df-finite-subset]]","[[93-df-monomorphism]]","[[93-df-pullback]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stable-finite-subobject-unions — Pullback-Stable Finite Subobject Unions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fbf91595366c330b\" href=\"?note=fbf91595366c330b\" title=\"93-df-finitely-complete-category\">93-df-finitely-complete-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"610e35470f5c7f53\" href=\"?note=610e35470f5c7f53\" title=\"93-df-finite-subobject-join\">93-df-finite-subobject-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"58d8bff43d6d4102\" href=\"?note=58d8bff43d6d4102\" title=\"93-df-monomorphism\">93-df-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7702f850d0f755f5\" href=\"?note=7702f850d0f755f5\" title=\"93-df-pullback\">93-df-pullback</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fbf91595366c330b\" href=\"?note=fbf91595366c330b\" title=\"93-df-finitely-complete-category\">93-df-finitely-complete-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (the object and hom-set projections inherited through <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fbf91595366c330b\" href=\"?note=fbf91595366c330b\" title=\"93-df-finitely-complete-category\">93-df-finitely-complete-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"610e35470f5c7f53\" href=\"?note=610e35470f5c7f53\" title=\"93-df-finite-subobject-join\">93-df-finite-subobject-join</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7702f850d0f755f5\" href=\"?note=7702f850d0f755f5\" title=\"93-df-pullback\">93-df-pullback</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}\\)</span> are the finite-set and monomorphism predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"58d8bff43d6d4102\" href=\"?note=58d8bff43d6d4102\" title=\"93-df-monomorphism\">93-df-monomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}\\)</span> (the stable finite-union predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf q\">\\(\\mathbf q\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf r\">\\(\\mathbf r\\)</span> explicitly index the individual pullback objects and their two projection families.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}finite\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}unions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall I\\;\\forall\\mathbf U\\;\\forall\\mathbf m\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\n\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\mathbf m\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(\\mathbf m(i),\\mathbf U(i),B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\exists m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(U,B)\\;\n\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B,B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B&#39;,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,U,m,P,p_U,p_{B&#39;},\\mathbf P,\\mathbf q,\\mathbf r\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_U,p_{B&#39;},m,g,U,B&#39;,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathbf P:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\mathbf q\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf P(i),\\mathbf U(i))\n\\land\\mathbf r\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf P(i),B&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(\\mathbf P(i),\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf r(i),\\mathbf m(i),g,\\mathbf U(i),B&#39;,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(P,p_{B&#39;},B&#39;,I,\\mathbf P,\\mathbf r,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}finite\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}unions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall I\\;\\forall\\mathbf U\\;\\forall\\mathbf m\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\n\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\mathbf m\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(\\mathbf m(i),\\mathbf U(i),B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\exists m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(U,B)\\;\n\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B,B&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B&#39;,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,U,m,P,p_U,p_{B&#39;},\\mathbf P,\\mathbf q,\\mathbf r\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_U,p_{B&#39;},m,g,U,B&#39;,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathbf P:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\mathbf q\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf P(i),\\mathbf U(i))\n\\land\\mathbf r\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf P(i),B&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(\\mathbf P(i),\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf r(i),\\mathbf m(i),g,\\mathbf U(i),B&#39;,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(P,p_{B&#39;},B&#39;,I,\\mathbf P,\\mathbf r,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first bracket requires every finite family of subobjects to have a join; the second says that pulling such a join back yields the join of the individually pulled-back subobjects. The family-typing clauses remain substantive when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span>, so existence and stability of the bottom subobject are both included.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-finitely-complete-category","status":"resolved","id":"fbf91595366c330b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finitely-complete-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subobject-join","status":"resolved","id":"610e35470f5c7f53","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subobject-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"58d8bff43d6d4102","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"7702f850d0f755f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finitely-complete-category","status":"resolved","id":"fbf91595366c330b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$ (see [[93-df-finitely-complete-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finitely-complete-category","status":"resolved","id":"fbf91595366c330b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}$ (the object and hom-set projections inherited through [[93-df-finitely-complete-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subobject-join","status":"resolved","id":"610e35470f5c7f53","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}$ (see [[93-df-finite-subobject-join]] and [[93-df-pullback]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"7702f850d0f755f5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}$ (see [[93-df-finite-subobject-join]] and [[93-df-pullback]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}$ are the finite-set and monomorphism predicates of [[93-df-finite-subset]] and [[93-df-monomorphism]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"58d8bff43d6d4102","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}$ are the finite-set and monomorphism predicates of [[93-df-finite-subset]] and [[93-df-monomorphism]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf r","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stable\\text{-}finite\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}unions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl[\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall I\\;\\forall\\mathbf U\\;\\forall\\mathbf m\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(I)\n\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\mathbf m\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf U(i),B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(\\mathbf m(i),\\mathbf U(i),B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\exists m\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(U,B)\\;\n\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall B,B'\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B',B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,U,m,P,p_U,p_{B'},\\mathbf P,\\mathbf q,\\mathbf r\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(U,m,B,I,\\mathbf U,\\mathbf m,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_U,p_{B'},m,g,U,B',B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathbf P:I\\to\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\mathbf q\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf P(i),\\mathbf U(i))\n\\land\\mathbf r\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbf P(i),B')\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(\\mathbf P(i),\\mathbf q(i),\\mathbf r(i),\\mathbf m(i),g,\\mathbf U(i),B',B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}(P,p_{B'},B',I,\\mathbf P,\\mathbf r,\\mathcal C)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":3097,"backlinks":[{"id":"703de0dbb1e0c2b6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}$ (pullback-stable finite subobject-union predicate, see [[93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions]])"},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions]]"}],"outgoing":["fbf91595366c330b","610e35470f5c7f53","6b63f2f43b5511ee","58d8bff43d6d4102","7702f850d0f755f5"]}